(their certificates. One company after another launched its stock with) Tj T*
(great display advertisements, and no hungry trout ever bit at a fly) Tj T*
(with more avidity than the greedy public gobbled up these ?investment?) Tj T*
(issues. Sober-minded people marvelled at the spectacle and wondered) Tj T*
(where all the money came from. In dozens of cases the advertisements) Tj T*
(stated that the stock had already been oversubscribed, and the notice) Tj T*
(appeared only as a matter of record. And so it happened that time and) Tj T*
