() Tj T*
(In one of the rush seasons when the stock exchange transactions were) Tj T*
(running from three to six million shares a day, with the tape lagging) Tj T*
(an hour or more behind, I knew a man who put in an order to sell a) Tj T*
(hundred shares short at $190, with a stop loss order at ten points) Tj T*
(above the purchase price, and an hour or so later, without any advice) Tj T*
(that the stock had been sold, he got notice that it had been bought in) Tj T*
(on his ?stop? at $200, resulting in a loss of a thousand dollars, plus) Tj T*
(commission. Next morning, not having received any notice of the short) Tj T*
(sale, he concluded that in the rush of business the order must have) Tj T*
(miscarried, and therefore he was long of a hundred shares, on which by) Tj T*
(the way he had a profit of five points. Shortly after the opening he) Tj T*
(sold it, and at the same time sold a hundred shares short. Later in the) Tj T*
(day he got word that his selling order of the day before had been duly) Tj T*
(executed, but owing to some mixup it had not been promptly reported.) Tj T*
(This made him three hundred shares short, with the stock climbing a) Tj T*
(half point or more between sales. Before the close he covered the three) Tj T*
(hundred shares at a loss of nearly four thousand dollars. The market) Tj T*
(looked so strong that he decided to recoup his loss on the long side,) Tj T*
(so he bought two hundred shares. But the following day while the bulls) Tj T*
(paused for a resting spell the stock slipped back nine points, and) Tj T*
(being a little upset over the result of his miscalculations, in a fit) Tj T*
(of disgust he closed out his two hundred shares at an additional loss) Tj T*
(of seventeen hundred dollars. Next day the bulls again took the stock) Tj T*
(in hand and advanced it nineteen points. No wonder such maneuvers give) Tj T*
(traders mental intoxication.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The collapse of the Florida real estate boom--which carried down dozens) Tj T*
(of banks,--the great Mississippi flood, the devastating earthquakes) Tj T*
(in California, the failure of a hundred or more banks throughout the) Tj T*
(Northwest and such-like calamities had no more effect on the Wall) Tj T*
(Street psychology than they would have had in quelling an epidemic of) Tj T*
