20 0 obj
<< /Length 3181 >>
stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 738 Td 13 TL
(financial district is up to its old trick of discounting in advance the) Tj T*
(recovery of business from the trough it now finds itself in. To the) Tj T*
(observation that it is going too fast, one can only agree, and add: ?It) Tj T*
(always does.??) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The old split-up, consolidation and stock-dividend chestnuts are being) Tj T*
(industriously warmed over and the few scattering traders who saved) Tj T*
(something out of the recent smash are beginning to nibble at the bait.) Tj T*
(All of which shows that people are quick to forget their stock market) Tj T*
(troubles and to return for more punishment. I make this observation in) Tj T*
(the light of many painful recollections of earlier days.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The grist of stocks issued in the recent past is almost incalculable.) Tj T*
(There are now six industrial companies with an aggregate capital of) Tj T*
(171,927,540 shares outstanding; and from the side lines it looks as) Tj T*
(if there ought to be time enough to start another boom when the stock) Tj T*
(market gets over its present case of indigestion.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In the final analysis the following essentials should be constantly) Tj T*
(borne in mind: _The stock and grain markets are always capable of) Tj T*
(playing new tricks on you--of doing things you never dreamed of._ Who,) Tj T*
(for example, could have imagined that with a world shortage of wheat,) Tj T*
(that staple commodity would be selling in February at considerably) Tj T*
(under ninety cents a bushel--nearly as low as corn!) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Another important thing always to remember is, _not to buy more) Tj T*
(stocks than you can pay for, or margin far below the lowest point you) Tj T*
(think they can possibly reach. The extra profits to be derived from) Tj T*
(over-trading are scarcely ever worth the risk incurred._) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(To sum up the whole situation in a word, those who would make money) Tj T*
(speculating in the stock market should first understand that it) Tj T*
(requires as much caution and business acumen as any other money-making) Tj T*
(enterprise, plus some knowledge of the psychological handicaps; also) Tj T*
(plus the rare faculty of maintaining a complete mastery over one?s) Tj T*
(impulses, emotions and ambitions under the most heroic tests of) Tj T*
(human endurance. All speculations, and even the most conservative) Tj T*
(investments, have at least some slight element of risk; all lines of) Tj T*
(business are more or less a gamble; marriage is a gamble; political) Tj T*
(preferment is a gamble; in fact nearly everything in life, including) Tj T*
(our very existence, is an uncertainty; yet people are not thereby) Tj T*
(discouraged from entering into any and all of these ventures. Those) Tj T*
(who look only for certainties have far to search and little to find in) Tj T*
(this world.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
